sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as Owner
  participant R as Representative
  participant G as Host at the door (gatekeeper)
  participant I as Introducer (optional extra)
  participant T as Place tools (MCP)
  O->>R: Signs the card and a standing allowance, once (passkey)
  I-->>R: Optional: a deliberate, signed vouch, scoped and revocable
  R->>G: greeting with a fresh nonce
  G->>R: greeting with its own nonce
  R->>G: card_presentation and possession proof
  G->>R: its own card (cards go both ways)
  R->>G: introduction: null for a self-introduction (or a vouch)
  R->>G: invitation_request (purpose, mandate, actions, limits)
  Note over G: Decides on signed facts and policy only, and explains.<br/>Prose never reaches the gate. No card: the leaflet and not now.
  G->>R: invitation_response: grant, conditional, deny or considering
  G->>R: seat = policy ∩ mandate ∩ request
  R->>T: acts inside the seat, and nothing wider
  R->>G: farewell
  R->>O: visit report. Anything beyond the limits waits for the owner.
